Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《里约大冒险2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果没有你 那爱是什么？ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ What is love if it's not with you? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我清楚 当你孤独时候 你也有这感觉 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I know when you're alone You feel it too ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.39,0:01:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我渴望 呆在你的怀里 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ In your arms is where I long to be ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 因为和你在一起 让我变得更加理性 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ 'Cause being with you gives me sanity ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 欢迎来到里约 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Welcome to Rio! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 听我唱 亲爱的 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Listen to me, darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.27,0:01:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 每天早上起床 我都在想你感受爱的方式 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I wake up every morning thinking about the way you feel ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我不清楚你是否知道 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I wonder if you know it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果没有你 这个派对算得了什么？ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And what good is the party If you're not around? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.45,0:01:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 但是 现在听我唱 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ But listen to me now ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.91,0:01:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 若不是你的爱 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ What good is love? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.54,0:01:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 那算什么样的爱？ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ If it's not your love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.67,0:01:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 什么才是爱啊？ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ What good is love? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我是你的爱吗？ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Am I your baby love? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果我不是你的爱 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ If it's not your love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 那这场疯狂的爱情算什么？ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Is it a crazy love? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我很高兴 我和各位在一起 在这场疯狂的派对上 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ This is a crazy party I'm so glad I'm here with everybody ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.01,0:01:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 宝贝 尽情地摇动你的身体吧 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Baby, move your body Shake it to the ground ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 鼓掌吧 鼓掌吧 接下去到你 布鲁 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Break it, break it, break it down, Blu ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你没听见 这算是一首什么歌？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a song if you can't hear it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 不能想象这舞蹈没有了你 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Can't imagine dancing without you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果你没有在我身边陪着我 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ A shooting star Ain't really nothing to see ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.41,0:02:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 即使流星划过 夜空中也不会留下痕迹 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ If you're not right here Standing next to me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 听我唱 亲爱的 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Listen to me, darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 每天早上 我一起床 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I wake up every morning ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 就会在想你感受爱的方式 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Thinking about the way you feel ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 不清楚你是否知道 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I wonder if you know it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果没有你 这个派对算得了什么？ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ What good is the party if you're not around? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 现在 听我唱 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Listen to me now ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果没有你的爱？ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ What good is love? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 那算是什么样的爱？ ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ If it's not your love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,明尼苏达州来的鸟还有自己的舞步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a bird from Minnesota, you've got some moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.06,0:02:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是舞步 这是灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't a move. That was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.07,0:02:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我接受你的恭维\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I accept the compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏拉斐尔能帮我们照顾孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great Rafael could watch the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.11,0:02:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 这样今天你得和我整晚在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it looks like you're stuck with me all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的唯一 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my one and only, Blu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那太好了 因为雄性的就剩我一个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a good thing, since I'm the only other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.79,0:02:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 比翼鸟 新年快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you lovebirds! Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔 他们在哪…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rafi? Where are the...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们和路易兹在一起 不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kids are with Luiz. No worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,担心 我们很担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worries. Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,路易兹 孩子们呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luiz? Where are the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？我又没有孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I don't have any kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.09,0:03:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 对了 我交给小不点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, right. I left them with Tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,小不点？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样？她可是很棒的保姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? She's an excellent babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是最差劲的保姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a terrible babysitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这一定会很炫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 我已经计算过了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I've done all the calculations...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,每次爆炸都会完美的踩在节奏点上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and each explosion will be perfectly synced to the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我没有算上这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless I didn't carry the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在我的视觉里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's my vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这有红色 蓝色 绿色 黄色 黄色 紫色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red, blue, green, yellow, yellow! Purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.37,0:03:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得会是… 嘣 砰 哧 嘭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's my vision. Boom! Crash! Bang! Kapow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你们爸妈不会想看到这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think your parents would like this very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是要去哪儿？小鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going, little bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 噢 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, what is this? - Oh, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道规矩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, you know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没有大人的监督 不能放烟花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pyrotechnics without adult supervision.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.93,0:03:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们问过小不点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We asked Tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.26,0:03:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这就更糟了 抱歉小不点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's even worse. Sorry, Tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,工钱我不要了 布鲁先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to pay me, Senhor Blu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们 下次玩 先问我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids, next time, ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可你每次都说不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you always say "no."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 你在否认现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, you're in denial.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我经常说"不"吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, do I always say "no"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.23,0:03:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 我是说 不 - 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. I mean, no. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,现在妈妈也在说"不"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Mom's saying it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们是地球上最后的蓝斯皮克斯金刚鹦鹉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, we are the last blue Spix's Macaws left on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得注意安全 有蓝色羽毛的鸟…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to stay safe. Birds of blue feathers...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,要团结在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我闻到烤鸡味了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I smell chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,根据我的计算 这是他今天说的第27个"不"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By my calculations, that's his twenty-seventh "no" today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 五 四 三 二 一 - 各位 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Five, four, three, two, one! - Everybody, fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,新年快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这不公平 凭什么 只有爸爸玩的这么爽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man. How come Dad gets to have all the fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊 成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:05:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,看来今年开了个好头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this year is off to a great start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,亚马逊之行 第七天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazon Expedition, day seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.65,0:05:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,距里约热内卢 2千英里…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two thousand miles from Rio...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到达热带雨林的中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've reached the center of the rainforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们沿着河流毫不费力地…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are surrounded by plants and animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,向前划行的时候…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}struggling for survival...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,周围都是挣扎生存的植物和动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as we glide effortlessly down the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,毫不费力的是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Effortless for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢 好漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,吐出来 快吐出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spit it out, spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经接近亚马逊树林地区鹌鹑的栖息地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are near the nesting grounds of the Amazonian Wood Quail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,云斑林鹑区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odontophorus gujanensis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,六个月前我们从走私者手中…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six months ago, we rescued this little bird...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,救下这只小鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from smugglers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候它生着病 营养不良…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was sick, malnourished...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:05:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,还断了一条腿 而现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a broken leg, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我可靠的助手…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my trusty assistant...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说我的妻子兼同事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, loving wife and colleague, will release her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就要把它放归回自然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back to her natural habitat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,都没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.12,0:06:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就像这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.03,0:06:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,还是让我跟她说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.34,0:06:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,怪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}FREAKS!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得她会没事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think she's gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,给她一点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 她在说什么？图里奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. What is she saying, Tulio?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,她是不舍得我们 在和我们说再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just hard for her to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得她好像在警告我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she's trying to warn us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能是吸引异性的舞蹈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might be some sort of mating dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,图里奥 看那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tulio! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快划 现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paddle! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好的 划啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, okay. Paddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,划啊 划啊 向前划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paddle, paddle! Backward, backward!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,往右 不 往左 往前 往前 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the right! No, left! Forward, forward! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.06,0:07:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你想清楚再说 图里奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make up your mind, Tulio!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这下可糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheese and sprinkles!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快划 快划 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paddle, paddle! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,图里奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tulio!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:08:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,琳达 琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda! Linda!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,图里奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tulio!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝 你没有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank heavens you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,图里奥 这是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tulio, is that a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,琳达 真难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda! This is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 珠儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Jewel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你们看我找到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Everyone, look what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.65,0:09:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都去哪儿了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did everybody...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 谁肚子饿了想吃早饭的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, who's ready for some breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那些全麦煎饼 所含的维生素矿物质是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that these whole wheat pancakes have twice the vitamins and minerals...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,普通煎饼的两倍吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of regular pancakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.41,0:09:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,而且加上蓝莓后味道会好上4倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with the blueberries, it's four times as tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.83,0:09:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 蓝莓都哪去了啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where are the blueberries?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你在找这个吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.17,0:09:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.80,0:09:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,已经到了最后关头 他的脚仿佛有魔力一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's down to the final minutes. He's got magic in his feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:09:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他射门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He shoots!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他得分了 - 球进了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He scores! Goal! - Goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,噢耶 我接到了 我真是太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I got it. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 注意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,帅呆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这下惨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.49,0:10:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 亲爱的 你饿了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, honey. Hey. You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.37,0:10:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁 我跟你说过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu, we talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 我不记得了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did we? I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.71,0:10:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 对的 你拿的是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, so, what do you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.55,0:10:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,早饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,很好笑 不过 说真的 这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny. But seriously, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个巴西栗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Brazil nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,离城市这么近的地方居然也有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought I would find one this close to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.59,0:10:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我要教孩子们怎么打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna show the kids how to open one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说打开这个吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸已经教过我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad already showed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Wait, go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你们上电视了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're on TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,巴西鸟类学家图里奥蒙泰罗博士…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Tulio Monteiro, the Bird Man of Brazil...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,今天宣布了一项重大发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}announced an important discovery today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:10:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们相信 我们在亚马逊丛林深处找到了野生的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe we have encountered a wild blue Spix's Macaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.03,0:11:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色金刚鹦鹉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}deep in the Amazon jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.03,0:11:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色金刚鹦鹉之前被认为在野外…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blue Spix's Macaw was thought to be practically extinct...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,全部灭绝了 仅存的一家鹦鹉…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the last remaining family living under protection...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,目前居住在里约的布鲁鸟类保护区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the Blu Bird Sanctuary in Rio de Janeiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们出名了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're famous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,如果找到这些野生鹦鹉 他们的家园将受到保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If these birds can be found, their home will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那里可能有很多这种鹦鹉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There may be a whole flock out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如果真的有 我们会找到他们 并保护他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if there is, we will find them and protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Blu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.09,0:11:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Linda!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是唯一的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not the only ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有活着的同类啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are more of us out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 太好了 我肯定 他们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's great. I'm sure they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这么长时间 我一直以为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this time, I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是孤独的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we were alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.27,0:11:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 以前也没有那么糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it hasn't been all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是挺好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.57,0:11:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可是想象一下 有一大群同类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But just imagine if there was a whole flock of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那该有多么美妙啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How amazing would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们得做点什么 - 真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We gotta do something. - We do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.41,0:11:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我们去亚马逊 去帮助琳达和图里奥找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we have to fly to the Amazon and help Linda and Tulio find them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢 我们不能说走就走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, we can't just pack up and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在正是时候出去让翅膀吹吹风了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about time this family got a little air under our wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我们 iPod 电视 煎饼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at us. IPods, TV. Pancakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是人类 我们可是鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not people, we're birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该回到野外 做真正的鸟 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get out into the wild and be birds, Blu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,让孩子们回到大自然吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the kids connect to their roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我们从前的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show them what I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要这样 我们也需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need this. We need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.19,0:12:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 布鲁 你说呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Blu, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.61,0:12:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有说"不"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't say "no."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这就意味着他可能会说"行"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means he practically said "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.53,0:12:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 等一下… - 那一定会很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, wait a sec... - It's gonna be so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.53,0:12:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去亚马逊咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to the Amazon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 亚马逊是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. What's the Amazon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,亚马逊 目前世界上最濒危的生态系统之一…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Amazon is one of Earth's most endangered ecosystems...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,由于非法砍伐和耕种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}due to illegal logging and farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们希望博士和他的团队…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hope Doctor Monteiro and his team...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,能找到那些珍惜鸟类 让他们的家园得以保存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can find these rare birds so their home can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那里可能有很多这种鹦鹉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There may be a whole flock out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果真的有 我们会找到它们并保护他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if there is, we will find them and protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,极端环保主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tree huggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的船准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get my boat ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:13:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我要亲自去处理这件事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to deal with this personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.82,0:13:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,轮到我了 行了你们可以回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be me. Okay, everybody can go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.53,0:13:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们正在看着的下一位 狂欢之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking at the next King of Carnival!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 大鸟 祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, big bird! Break a leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,走路小心点 别躺着进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk it off, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你看不到它的到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't see it coming
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你在别的地方找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't find it anywhere else
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,棒极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,伊娃 亲爱的 你刚才一个音符也没落下 伙计们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eva, darling, you hit every note. Huh, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是的 还多了很多我从来没听过的音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, along with a bunch of notes I never heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.57,0:13:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rafi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我会和他们说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. I'll talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我会为你找到完美的角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find the perfect spot for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,南极洲 大概吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Antarctica, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:13:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,最好如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.83,0:14:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们家里见 我的美味小芒果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you back at home, my tasty mango!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.51,0:14:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这些表演一点都不好 我连一点灵感都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of these acts are inspiring. I'm just not inspired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,狂欢节眼看就要到了 我们的名声会毁于一旦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carnival is right around the corner, and our reputations are on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.05,0:14:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要些能让我们嗨起来的节奏 我们需要动感火爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need something that can make us wiggle. Something that make us jiggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要激情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need something that pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道激情怎么说吗？啪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what "pop" is backwards? Pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.77,0:14:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 路易兹 我也很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, Luiz. Good to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 布鲁 我们在寻找一位歌手…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Blu, we are looking for a singer...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一个舞者 样样都会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a dancer, the whole package.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.49,0:14:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不要唱歌跑调 跳舞摔跤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and you're more of a mumbler-shuffler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.83,0:14:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You catch my drift?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是来面试的 我有事情要宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not here to audition. I've got news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备要去亚马逊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am going to the Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哇呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.05,0:14:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,亚马逊？哇 真够狂野\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Amazon? Wow, that's wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀 珠儿觉得这对我们有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Jewel thinks it'll be good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有多狂野\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How wild?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.34,0:14:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,超级无敌狂野\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那里的蚊子能够一口吸干你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got mosquitoes that suck your blood like Slurpees.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.68,0:14:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那里的蛇能一口将你整个吞下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snakes that can swallow you whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.23,0:15:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那里还有吃肉的食人鱼 会吃肉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flesh-eating piranhas that eat flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.61,0:15:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 听起来真棒 我不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, that sounds really nice. I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, guys, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁 你根本不用担心这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu, you have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说的这些都有点夸张的过分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those stories are highly exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真的这么想？- 当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think so? - Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这对珠儿很重要 那你就去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is important to Jewel, just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,老婆开心 日子舒心 一定要记住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy wife, happy life. Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 是噢 你说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.17,0:15:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就当全家一起去度假 一定很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little family vacation might actually be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,再说了 又不是定居在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus, it's not like it's forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,耶 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.43,0:15:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,过段时间见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you in a couple of weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,一路顺风 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Safe travels, Blu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,记得带纪念品回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me back a souvenir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,得了 他不会回来了 他会死掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawg, he ain't coming back. He is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,亚马逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 快点爸爸 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Come on, Dad! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 驱虫剂 净水剂 还有创可贴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Bug spray, check. Water purifier, check. Band-Aids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.78,0:15:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我好像忘了点什么 - 酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I feel like I'm forgetting something. - Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.99,0:15:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是多功能瑞士军刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The all-in-one adventurer's knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这个交给我来弄吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be in charge of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:15:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是给你准备的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 爸爸 来看我这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dad, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道亚马逊的蛇能一口把你吃掉吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know the Amazon has snakes that can swallow you whole?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上这些故事写得太夸张了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, Bia, all those stories are highly exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不一定吧 你看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, really. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好恶心啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好出发了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, are we ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你带了个腰包？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A fanny pack? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,琳达给我的 用来装GPS定位器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda gave it to me. I need it for the GPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我的GPS呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the GPS?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.18,0:16:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 卡拉 我们要走啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! - Carla, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不去呢 肯定很无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going. It's gonna be lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,它有语音识别功能 很好用的 你看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The voice recognition makes it totally foolproof. Here, watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"给我找琳达和图里奥"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find Linda and Tulio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,正在搜索"去东京吃料理"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Searching for "Dinner in Tokyo."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.41,0:16:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 额 事实上这个还真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Actually, that does sound like a nice suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你相信这个女人？- 是的 我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You trust this woman? - Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 等下 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait up, family!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也要一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心哥们 我们会罩着你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, buddy. We got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,伊娃 让你去了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eva let you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我答应她在狂欢演出里给她弄个角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. I promised her a spot in the Carnival show.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 答应她什么？- 你们迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You did what? - You guys are late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是有点晚 - 但我们可是音乐家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clock-late. - But musician-early.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你们也要去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, you guys are coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:16:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当然不会错过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wouldn't miss it for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.05,0:17:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去丛林寻找最棒的歌手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gonna scout the wildest, coolest talent in the jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们今年狂欢节演出的创作灵感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our inspiration for this year's Carnival show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"狂野的亚马逊"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Amazon Untamed."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.98,0:17:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 好的 我也会去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, yeah. Okay. I guess I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,去亚马逊放手一搏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazon jungle or bust, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,都准备好去热带探险了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is ready for a tropical adventure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 出发吧 小鸟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right! - Let's go, birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等 孩子们 还没有点名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, we didn't do a head count. Hey, guys, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.66,0:17:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,重新规划路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recalculating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 小鸟 快回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, birds! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.38,0:17:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,又是这样 丢下我自己走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They left without me. Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.13,0:17:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太让人伤心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,里约热内卢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rio de Janeiro
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,欧鲁普雷图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ouro Preto
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:18:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,巴西利亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brasilia
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.08,0:18:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,前方道路 拥堵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heavy traffic ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,棒啊 多谢了 GPS小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Thanks a lot, GPS lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster, faster, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.49,0:18:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点 慢点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slower! Slower! Slower!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,从里约热内卢到马瑙斯 我们这里是天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From Rio to Manaus We are here in paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了孩子们 这里就是亚马逊的大门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are, kids. The gateway to the Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"生存…"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To be..."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.07,0:19:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"或是毁灭…"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"or not to be..."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"这是个问题"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"that is the question."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,"究竟哪一个更高贵…"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Whether 'tis nobler in the mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"去忍受这命运 还是去忍受着无边的烦恼…"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"to suffer the slings and arrows of outrageous fortune...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.92,0:19:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"经受无边的摧残…"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"or to take arms against a sea of troubles..."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"还是把它忘个干净"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"and, by opposing, end them."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 真实太美妙了 奈杰尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's beautiful, Nigel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡 加比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death, Gabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,说的是死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 奈杰尔 我爱死你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nigel, I love it when you get all dark and brooding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.73,0:20:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 笨鸟 该上场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, bird. It's show time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.44,0:20:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我的观众正等着我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My audience awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,从里约的丛林 到亚马逊的街头…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the streets of Rio, to the Amazon jungle...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.91,0:20:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有请 神秘的大鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the bird of mystery!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.91,0:20:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,灵丹妙药 毒蛙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miracle cures! Poison frogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 火蚁 - 别害羞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fire ants! - Don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,了解属于你的命运吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Learn your destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.80,0:20:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 别打蚂蚁的主意 干你的活去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Get away from those! Back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈 我要玩这个 占卜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy, Mommy, I want one! I want a fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这只难以置信的鹦鹉 能够预示你的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This amazing cockatoo will reveal your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好了小鸟 选一个吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, bird. Pick a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.15,0:20:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 小鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.11,0:20:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你干的很好 奈杰尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing great, Nigel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.24,0:20:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 伙计们 就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, gang. Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,今天不用再飞了 我们能赶上一艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more flying today. We've got a boat to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.83,0:20:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,根据GPS的计算 明天一早我们就能到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to my little friend here, this boat will get us there by morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他能活下来 但永远也飞不起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll live, but he'll never fly again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 小鸟 - 我要知道我的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, bird. - I want my fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 奈杰尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing great, Nigel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么要这么长时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.52,0:21:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么啦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,都是那只蓝色的鸟害的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That blue bird caused my misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,小鸟乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice birdie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要打自己 为什么要打自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you hitting yourself? Why are you hitting yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.38,0:21:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,奈杰尔好有男子汉气概\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. Nigel is muy macho.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.22,0:21:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有只箭毒蛙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poison frog!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嘎嘎叫的凤头鹦鹉 呐喊着要去复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The croaking cockatoo doth bellow for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.25,0:22:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便一提 这是莎士比亚写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Shakespeare, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没有你的表演 他一文不值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without your performance, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.67,0:22:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.19,0:22:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这空气 又清新 又舒适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This air! It's so fresh and full.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.53,0:22:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了 城市里的雾霾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, stinky city air!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.91,0:22:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 谢谢你能为我这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Thank you for doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.75,0:23:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,为了你 我愿意做任何事情 你懂的 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would do anything for you. You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.54,0:23:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是来这吃点心的 我们是来复仇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We aren't here to snack. We are here to avenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等乘客都睡着的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once these pesky passengers fall asleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就好好关爱下我的蓝色朋友们 给他们一点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll show our blue friends some love. Some...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,毒爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}poisonous love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.24,0:23:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这个我最拿手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.49,0:23:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在午夜发动攻击…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We attack at the midnight hour...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.00,0:23:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这样显得更加邪恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it's more evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.33,0:23:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,保持警惕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,午夜 袭击的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Midnight! Time to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.47,0:23:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,奈杰尔 奈杰尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nigel! Nigel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.52,0:24:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我们 两个另类生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at us. Misfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.19,0:24:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一只剧毒的青蛙 一只不会飞的怪鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A toxic frog, and a flightless freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们如此的不同 又如此的相同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So different, and yet, the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 当你睡着了 所有都是美好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My darling, while you sleep All is well
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是朋友 那样很好 可是有个秘密一定要告诉你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are friends, and that's swell But the truth is that I have a secret to tell
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.66,0:24:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.17,0:24:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,人们说这不对 很可笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People say it's wrong It's absurd
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.83,0:24:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一只青蛙怎么和鸟恋爱 可我心里知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That a frog and a bird are in love But I know in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.84,0:24:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是命中注定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was so meant to be
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.01,0:24:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们能拥抱亲吻 那真是天堂般的幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only we could hug and could kiss It'd be heavenly bliss
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.14,0:24:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可你的肺会烂掉 就像这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your lungs would explode And you'd look just like this
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.51,0:24:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你会窒息 脸涨成蓝色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'd gag With your face turning blue
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.35,0:24:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,噢…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eww
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.02,0:24:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不过亲爱的 我会照顾你 我会的 你尽管放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, darling, I'll protect you I will, don't worry, just chill
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.06,0:24:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我能杀掉任何鸟 只要是为了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause there isn't a bird That I wouldn't kill
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你看不出来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you can't you see
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.41,0:24:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们注定要在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were destined to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.24,0:25:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为我们的爱 - 爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For we have love - Love
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.91,0:25:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有毒的爱 - 爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Poisonous love - Love
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.38,0:25:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然这样 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And although, yes
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.25,0:25:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你没法拥抱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that you can't hold me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.72,0:25:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,投入我的怀抱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel me close now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.85,0:25:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你爱的翅膀 围绕着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your loving wings enfold me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.39,0:25:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,命运告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fate told me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.19,0:25:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.94,0:25:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有毒的爱 - 爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Poisonous love - Love
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.15,0:25:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,站在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standing here
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.95,0:25:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你离我是如此的近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so near And yet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.41,0:25:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,又那么远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So far
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.24,0:25:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就像一颗星星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.91,0:25:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.08,0:25:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.96,0:25:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.67,0:25:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,怎办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To do
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.63,0:25:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 唉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, pooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.51,0:25:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的罗密欧 我是你的朱丽叶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my Romeo I'm Juliet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们天生一对 可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're so perfect, and yet
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.81,0:26:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们触碰哪怕一点点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we touch, not by much
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.14,0:26:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可以确信一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still on all you can bet
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.31,0:26:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是 永别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.31,0:26:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会哭泣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll cry
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.94,0:26:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你已不再\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you die
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.16,0:26:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,死于我们有毒的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From our poisonous love
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.47,0:26:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.64,0:26:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该把我叫醒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were supposed to wake me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.52,0:26:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要行动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.86,0:26:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,能做奈杰尔的搭档真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love being on Team Nigel!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.26,0:28:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不出什么比在夜晚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't think of anything more romantic
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.92,0:28:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,给乘客下毒更浪漫的事情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than poisoning passengers on a moonlight cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.64,0:28:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.89,0:28:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.23,0:28:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一闪一闪小布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twinkle, twinkle little Blu.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.61,0:28:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,找你找得好辛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How I wondered, where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.27,0:28:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,高高的挂在天空中…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up above the world so high...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.32,0:28:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,今天让你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are you ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.45,0:28:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一命呜呼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.74,0:28:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该吃块绿箭薄荷糖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need a breath mint.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.58,0:28:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你睡着了都要嘲笑我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even in sleep, you mock me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.80,0:28:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.26,0:28:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别丢下我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.85,0:28:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,迪耶戈 别到处乱跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiago! Stop fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.81,0:28:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么也没干啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.44,0:28:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,迪耶戈·冈德森 听你妈妈的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiago Gunderson, listen to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.36,0:28:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.32,0:29:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快到了 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're almost there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.32,0:29:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 等一下 伙计们 - 过来 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, guys. Wait up. - Come on, Blu.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.03,0:29:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 有蓝色…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, birds of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.20,0:29:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nevermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.49,0:29:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.16,0:29:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快醒醒 你这个吃蚂蚁的笨蛋 快跟上他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, you insect-eating idiot. Follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.50,0:29:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好多了 现在给我快一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better. Now go ten times faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.30,0:29:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这个笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}River hogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.76,0:30:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.88,0:30:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在想 你是不是比猴子还笨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always suspected you were dumber than a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.39,0:30:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.72,0:30:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,老板 您来丛林里干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boss! What are you doing in the jungle?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.43,0:30:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样问 会好点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps the better question is...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.60,0:30:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来这里干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.73,0:30:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那些环保狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nature freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.11,0:30:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有几百万平方英里的丛林…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two million square miles of jungle...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.74,0:30:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,可他们却偏偏跑到这里来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they're playing in my backyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.07,0:30:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是好惹的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.12,0:30:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道 朋友 我们的伐木作业 稍微有点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know, my friends, this logging operation is a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.75,0:30:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,违法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.08,0:30:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这些人找到那些鸟 我们的生意就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If those two nuts find those birds, we're out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.92,0:30:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.34,0:30:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要尽快结束他们的寻鸟丛林探险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must put an end to their little bird-watching expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.30,0:30:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,找到他们 赶走他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find them and get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.84,0:30:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,其余的人 都给我砍树去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of you, go cut some trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.10,0:30:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在乎一群什么破鸟啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who cares about a bunch of birds?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.85,0:31:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,鹦鹉会把鸟巢筑在巴西栗树附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The macaws should be nesting near the Brazil nut trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.19,0:31:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我觉得我们应该…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I think that we should continue with go...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.03,0:31:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,图里奥 你在听我说话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tulio! Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.53,0:31:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你已到达目的地了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have reached your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.70,0:31:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看 是不是很管用 我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see? It works like a charm. Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.54,0:31:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.95,0:31:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西稍微有点误差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These things have a margin of error.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.79,0:31:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说过别相信那个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you not to trust that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.04,0:31:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个幼虫 它就要进入变蛹的阶段了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a Heliconious larva. It's about to enter the pupa stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.96,0:31:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,哈 你说桶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said "poop!"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.80,0:31:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 孩子们 跟紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, kids. Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.13,0:31:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去找他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.30,0:31:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你们留在这里别动 我去周边看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you guys stay put. I'll look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.81,0:31:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我们就在这 我们哪儿都不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No worries. We'll be here. We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.48,0:31:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我后背的羽毛都竖起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My feathers is popping up on the back of my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.64,0:31:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不喜欢这个感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.48,0:31:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们掉头吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's back it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.82,0:31:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,比亚？迪耶戈？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bia? Tiago?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.74,0:31:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.83,0:31:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别让我失望 - 规划前往"秀场的路线"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't let me down. - Calculating route to "Funky Town."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.91,0:31:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.17,0:32:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.55,0:32:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.72,0:32:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵 可以 这很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good one, guys. Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.18,0:32:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 很好 很聪明的玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, good. Very witty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.77,0:32:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,珠儿 你在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jewel, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.35,0:32:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们 珠儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids? Jewel?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.57,0:32:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色金刚鹦鹉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Macaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.86,0:32:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.19,0:32:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.95,0:32:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我 你这个野蛮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go, you heathens!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.87,0:32:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.41,0:32:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓 这声音听起来像布鲁的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear that sounded like Blu.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.87,0:32:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不可能 琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible, Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.54,0:32:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他在家里 既舒适又安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's back home in Rio, safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.38,0:32:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是美国公民 你这个野蛮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am an American citizen, you savage!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.25,0:32:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我要求见美国大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I demand to see my ambassador!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.92,0:32:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我有这个权利 我有这个权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know my rights! I know my rights!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.22,0:32:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,退后 退后 野蛮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back. Back, you barbarian!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.89,0:32:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.26,0:33:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个勺子 也是个叉子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a spoon and a fork.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.27,0:33:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,害怕了吧 怕的发抖了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be afraid! Be very afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.89,0:33:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊噢 哥们 把你的东西放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Whoa, buddy. Put the spork down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.90,0:33:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 有种来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me go! - Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.11,0:33:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧 你很好彩 我没那么大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! You lucky I ain't big.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.01,0:33:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 我们找到他们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe we found them!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.68,0:33:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,严格的说 是他们找到了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically, they found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.73,0:33:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 得找点东西来写名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we're gonna need some nametags.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.02,0:33:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.69,0:33:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 那是绿箭薄荷糖 你用不到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, those are breath mints. Not that you need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不过味道还不错 你可以试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they're good. You eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.07,0:33:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 别连盒都吞下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! Not the whole box.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.03,0:34:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快把它吐出来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that out of your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.16,0:34:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事情啦？怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this doing here? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.21,0:34:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发现他们飞得离人类太近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found them flying too close to the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.29,0:34:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 你是谁？- 呃…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? And who are you? - Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.21,0:34:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"呃"可不是一个合适的回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Uh" is not an appropriate answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.13,0:34:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你话呢 你们到底从哪来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked you a question. Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.47,0:34:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.59,0:34:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, excuse me, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.89,0:34:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.93,0:34:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.77,0:34:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,伐木工来的时候…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the loggers came...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.73,0:34:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都是大火 到处都是浓烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was fire, and so much smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.23,0:34:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你藏在翅膀下面 然后你就…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had you under my wing, and then you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.49,0:34:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.44,0:34:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've looked everywhere for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.40,0:34:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.62,0:34:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.20,0:34:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"爸爸"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Daddy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.12,0:34:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我好想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.33,0:34:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 一切都过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. It's okay, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.75,0:34:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有爸爸在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy has you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.88,0:34:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.51,0:35:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我的小女儿 已经长大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my little girl, all grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.97,0:35:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,长得这么漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.97,0:35:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你的妈妈一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.31,0:35:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我把你弄丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry I lost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.69,0:35:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法想象这些年你一个人到底怎么过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't imagine you alone, all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.36,0:35:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 爸爸 我不孤单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's okay, Dad. I wasn't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.07,0:35:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁找到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.83,0:35:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure is nice to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.50,0:35:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,把翅膀收起来 斯图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tuck that wing away, Stu.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.88,0:35:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到我这来 - 对 当然 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, come here. - Right, sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.34,0:35:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 近一点 - 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Closer. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.09,0:35:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,再近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.01,0:35:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我女儿带回来了 我谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought my Jewel back to me. I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.09,0:35:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在我要拥抱你 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna hug you now. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.35,0:35:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行了 过来吧 - 好了 抱上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, come here, you. - Okay. There we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.73,0:35:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真是我的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.98,0:35:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 你在哭吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nico. You crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.81,0:35:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看到这么感人的场面 我内心很脆弱啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a heavy moment, and I'm very vulnerable right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.44,0:35:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,来这 让我也给你一个拥抱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here. Let me get you a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.15,0:36:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.12,0:36:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"妈妈"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mom"?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.37,0:36:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我当外公了？我当外公了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a grandpa? I'm a grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.49,0:36:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 我是外公了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me, I'm a grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.16,0:36:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 这是卡拉 比亚 迪耶戈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy, this is Carla, Bia and Tiago.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.42,0:36:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你好呀 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.79,0:36:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不要叫我先生 我的小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no "sir" around here, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.96,0:36:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你应该叫我"帕帕" - 帕帕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You will call me "Pop-Pop!" - Pop-Pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.30,0:36:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢 这是个真好听的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like that. It's got a nice ring to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.80,0:36:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我是"帕帕"啊 太好啦 我是外公啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a Pop-Pop! Yeah, I'm the Pop-Pop-Pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.18,0:36:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,别把"帕帕"弄伤了 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids, go easy on old Pop-Pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.43,0:36:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你还得叫我"先生"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can call me "sir."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.77,0:36:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我女儿回来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daughter has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.69,0:36:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这些年我们东躲西藏的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years, we have been on the run...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.74,0:36:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,人类把我们逼往 越来越深的丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the humans push us deeper into the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.95,0:36:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你看 我们找到了一个避难所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as you can see, we have found sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.28,0:36:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于可以在这里扎根了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A place we can finally put down roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.20,0:36:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 出来吧 大伙们 出来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone! Come on! Everyone, out of your nests!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.21,0:36:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我女儿回来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daughter is home!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.63,0:37:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,出来吧小鸟们 我的珠儿回来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, birds. My Jewel is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.84,0:37:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,珠儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jewel?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.97,0:37:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,让开 让开 珠儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make way. Make way! Jewel!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.76,0:37:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,咪咪婶婶 咪咪婶婶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt Mimi? Aunt Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.98,0:37:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我可想死你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.64,0:37:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的小野花终于回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My little wildflower has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.86,0:37:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会回来 我会用鸟粪算命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you were coming back. I saw it in the droppings.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.82,0:37:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这些小家伙们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And look at the little ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.57,0:37:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谁才是最可爱的小蓝皮克斯鹦鹉啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you the fluffiest, most delicious little macaws?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.49,0:37:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你长得可有点着急啊 - 咪咪婶…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're big for your age. - Mimi...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.00,0:37:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is Sue.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.08,0:37:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 事实上我叫布鲁 - 我们不都是蓝色的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Actually, I'm Blu. - Aren't we all?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.25,0:37:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不 实际上 那是我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, really, that's my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.09,0:37:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,金刚鹦鹉可全部都是蓝色的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why they call us "Blue Macaws."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.09,0:37:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你就依着她吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.68,0:37:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,原来这样 那你在这种鸟里长得算是挫的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, that's what a Blue Macaw is supposed to look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.44,0:37:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看她 多耀眼啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at her shining
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.02,0:38:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,她的羽毛 闪闪发光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her feathers, they glow
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.61,0:38:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 丛林都在欢笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the jungle is smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.53,0:38:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们的宝贝回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause our baby's home
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.45,0:38:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否和我一样的感受？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you feel what I feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.41,0:38:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这一天终于来到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The day has come at last
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.58,0:38:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们心爱的珠儿回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our precious Jewel has returned
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.37,0:38:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我要第一个唱出来 欢迎回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be the first to sing Welcome back
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.04,0:38:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roberto. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.25,0:38:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.13,0:38:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 欢迎 欢迎 欢迎 欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said welcome, welcome, welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.06,0:38:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.94,0:38:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 你看上去棒极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, you look great!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.27,0:38:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.23,0:38:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你好 我是珠儿的… 重要的那一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, hey. Hi, there. I am Jewel's significant other.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.90,0:38:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 那你就是那个俘获了珠珠芳心的幸运鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're the lucky bird who swept Ju-Ju off her feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.45,0:38:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- "珠珠"？- 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Ju-Ju"? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.24,0:38:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们还是孩子时 就一直给对方起可爱的小名了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we were kids, we always had the cutest nicknames for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.95,0:38:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也是 我叫他"背头"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did. I called him "Beto."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.41,0:38:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那真可爱 我也喜欢起小名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's adorable. I love doing the nicknames.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.46,0:39:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你可从来没提起过什么罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never mentioned any "Roberto."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.46,0:39:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他没有什么可提的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing to mention.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.84,0:39:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.09,0:39:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我的搭档来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's my wingman!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.42,0:39:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有罗伯特放哨 我们都能安心睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can rest easy with Roberto on the lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.55,0:39:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏艾迪教会我一切 全靠你这只好鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eduardo taught me everything I know. He's the bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.59,0:39:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你才是好鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You're the bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.39,0:39:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 你是只好鸟 - 你才是好鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, you're the bird. - You're the bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.22,0:39:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了 你们两个都是好鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get it. You're both "the bird."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.22,0:39:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能别唧唧歪歪了 开始聚会吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, can we stop yakking and start partying?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.90,0:39:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢 我记得这首歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! I remember this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.15,0:39:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能忘记 它一直流淌在我们的血液里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you forget? It's in our blood, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.94,0:39:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是只属于我们的歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.61,0:39:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你不介意我借用她一会的 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't mind if I borrow her for a minute, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 事实上… - 来吧 珠珠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Actually... - Come on, Ju-Ju!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.16,0:39:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.58,0:39:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们在一起唱响爱与和谐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's come together Singing love and harmonia
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.46,0:39:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们外形各不相同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are so different
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.42,0:39:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们的心都是同向的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the same inside our hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.84,0:39:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色 美丽的颜色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blue-tiful colors
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.30,0:39:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,尽你目光所及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as the eye can see
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.51,0:39:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,张开翅膀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your wings
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.85,0:40:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,当你听见召唤 展翅翱翔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly when you hear the call
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.77,0:40:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们为了所有美丽的生物而庆祝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's celebrate Calling all beautiful creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.44,0:40:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,张开的你翅膀 我们为自由而舞蹈和歌唱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come spread your wings Dance and sing songs about freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.11,0:40:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样 啦啦啦 噢噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like la-la-la, ooh-ooh
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.82,0:40:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 整个丛林是一家 - 来啊 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One for the jungle family - Come on, Blu!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.83,0:40:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样 叭叭啦 嘣嘣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like ba-ba-ba, boom-boom
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.79,0:40:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 叫上所有美丽的生物 - 嘿 珠儿 珠儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Calling all beautiful creatures - Hey, Jewel? Jewel!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.29,0:40:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,来到这里 一起庆祝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come this way, celebrate
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.88,0:40:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,尽情的欢笑和舞蹈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laugh and dance all the way
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.63,0:40:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 这个地方真是潜力无穷啊 我好喜欢他们这种歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, this is untapped territory. I'm loving this sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.94,0:40:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,帕帕 我是外公啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pop-Pop! I am a Pop-Pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.20,0:40:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你们的帕帕 好耶 我是你们的外公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your Pop-Pop! Yeah, I am the Pop-Pop
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.32,0:40:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 外公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, the Pop-Pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.83,0:41:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们为了所有美丽的生物而庆祝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's celebrate Calling all beautiful creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.71,0:41:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,张开的你翅膀 我们为自由而舞蹈和歌唱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come spread your wings Dance and sing songs about freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.38,0:41:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样 啦啦啦 噢噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like la-la-la, ooh-ooh
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.17,0:41:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,整个丛林是一家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One for the jungle família
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.18,0:41:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样 叭叭啦 嘣嘣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like ba-ba-ba, boom-boom
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.80,0:41:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,叫上所有美丽的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calling all beautiful creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.82,0:41:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你能理解 孤苦伶仃是什么感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only one who knows what it feels like to be all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.86,0:41:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是误解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.74,0:41:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你邪恶 我狠毒 噢呵呵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the evil to my lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.33,0:41:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该改个名字叫"话唠"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see why they call you "Gabi."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.75,0:41:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪儿呢？你这个肮脏的家禽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you, you filthy fowl?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.83,0:41:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.01,0:41:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前的行动战略不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been going about this all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.05,0:41:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该去更高的地方找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to search from higher ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.52,0:42:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才腾空了 将近整整一秒钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stayed airborne for almost a full second that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.87,0:42:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 太不可思议了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravoable, incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.61,0:42:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你看什么看啊 快帮我上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at? Get me up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.61,0:42:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,高点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.19,0:42:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,高点 再高点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Higher! Even higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.45,0:42:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微再高点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little bit higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.37,0:42:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,低点 现在低点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower. Lower, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.70,0:42:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,现在正好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.42,0:42:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这么一大群祸害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an infestation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.55,0:42:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,继续庆祝吧 你们很快就要高兴不起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep celebrating. I'll be pooping on your party promptly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.89,0:42:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 尼克 嗨 佩克罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Nico! Hi, Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.10,0:42:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来对地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We came to the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.48,0:42:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是火爆 亚马逊的火爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is popping. It's popping in the Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.81,0:42:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要把这些金刚鹦鹉带回里约…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could bring these macaws back to Rio...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.69,0:42:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,参加有史以来最棒的狂欢节演出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and have the best Carnival show ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.69,0:42:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在灵感如泉涌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am inspired!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.49,0:43:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,十分抱歉 城里来的鸟…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to break it to you, city boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.99,0:43:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你们还是去找别的明星吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you'll have to find some other talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.83,0:43:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,谁也不许离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody leaves the tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.12,0:43:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 丛林里不许留下人类的东西 听懂了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no human things in the jungle. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.29,0:43:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？他什么毛病？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What's his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.46,0:43:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我被扒光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.67,0:43:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,差点就能流芳百世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could have been legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.63,0:43:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经超级无敌了 可是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We already are super-mega-dope, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.22,0:43:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.68,0:43:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都有啊 没被发掘的明星…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had it all. The undiscovered talent...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.06,0:43:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好的创意 涌现的灵感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the big idea, the inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.06,0:43:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可是没有办法把他们带回里约…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we can't bring these guys to Rio...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.85,0:43:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.98,0:43:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.86,0:43:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别那么失落嘛 我们还有伊娃啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your mangoes. We still have Eva.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.65,0:43:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.16,0:43:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢 你跳的还是那么好 珠珠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! You still got the moves, Ju-Ju.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.37,0:43:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我快累死了 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm so exhausted. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.87,0:43:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该去休息了 找个旅馆或者酒店什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should get some rest. Find a local inn, or B and B nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.33,0:43:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你在胡说些什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this crazy talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.71,0:43:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你们就住我家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you guys are staying in my nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.88,0:43:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚我巡逻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on patrol tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.38,0:43:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我的家 就是你们的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mi casa es su casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.34,0:43:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是太好了 背头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's really nice, Beto.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.88,0:44:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 但我觉得我们能搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, but we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.38,0:44:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,再说我们一大家子 住单身公寓 恐怕挤不下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, our whole family couldn't possibly fit in your bachelor pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.26,0:44:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.68,0:44:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的房价一定非常低吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real estate must be pretty cheap around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.64,0:44:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢 真是不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.73,0:44:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你说这里？这只是我最近随便弄的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This old nest? It's just something I put together last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.44,0:44:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 用的是我的两只翅膀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With my own two wings, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.90,0:44:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我的力气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.61,0:44:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我的肌肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my brawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.82,0:44:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 这里好大 有六个卧室呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, it's huge! It has six bedrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.78,0:44:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要最大的这间 - 不 我是最年长的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I get the big one! - No! I'm the oldest.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.58,0:44:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就比我大3分钟外加2.5秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only by 3 minutes, 2.5 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.92,0:44:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望有一天…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had hoped to one day be blessed...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.46,0:44:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有一群小鬼抢房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a flock of little Robertos to call my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.79,0:44:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一定会的 - 不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I bet you did. - No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.84,0:44:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还有鸟浴盆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bird bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.47,0:44:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,迪耶戈 小心…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiago, caref...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.64,0:44:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还有按摩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacuzzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.68,0:44:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁 我告诉你一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu, let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.02,0:44:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,要是 我意思是 如果你出了任何事 任何…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anything, and I mean anything, ever happens to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.77,0:44:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我会帮忙照顾好你的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will take care of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.32,0:45:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 哥们 睡个好觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, buddy. Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.28,0:45:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 晚安 珠珠 - 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night, Ju-Ju. - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.13,0:45:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 一切都安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.09,0:45:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,月光和星光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moon beams and starlight
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.51,0:45:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇的曙光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magical twilight
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.72,0:45:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,最温暖的雨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The warmest rain
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.68,0:45:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,听它低吟你的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear it whispering your names?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.98,0:45:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,午夜的彩虹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rainbows at midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.44,0:45:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让星空闪耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sparkling night skies
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.48,0:45:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不要远走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go away
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.57,0:45:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,多停留一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay another day
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.91,0:45:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 你能再唱一遍吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you sing it again, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.20,0:45:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 该睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for bed, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.25,0:46:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,多棒的一天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an amazing day.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.13,0:46:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,一直以来 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.72,0:46:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我都没奢望过他们还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never let myself hope that they were alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.64,0:46:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他们还都活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.60,0:46:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到家人了 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found our family, Blu.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.94,0:46:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这会改变一切的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.82,0:46:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.36,0:46:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 什么？改变什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. What? What's changing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.78,0:46:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,珠儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jewel?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.95,0:47:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,去… 去 走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoo, shoo, shoo. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.39,0:47:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 别 别这样 很痒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, stop. That tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.73,0:47:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈 真有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.36,0:47:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,迪耶戈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiago!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.41,0:47:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 迪耶戈 看我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Tiago. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.17,0:48:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.54,0:48:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,或者我应该说 "下午好"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or should I say "afternoon"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.34,0:48:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.47,0:48:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,生活在这里得习惯早起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our days here in the jungle, they start early.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.09,0:48:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.51,0:48:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真是我的好女儿 她早就起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my girl. See? Already up and at 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.31,0:48:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.35,0:48:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛让我睡懒觉呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you let me sleep in?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.89,0:48:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢？你每天都睡懒觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? You sleep in every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.44,0:48:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 可是… - 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, but... - Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.02,0:48:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,咪咪阿姨说泥土对消化有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt Mimi says clay is good for your digestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.19,0:48:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 试试啊 - 不 宝贝 我这才刚刚刷过牙…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Try some. - No, sweetie. I just brushed my...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.07,0:48:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,味道不错 是吧？我要再去弄点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good, right? I'm gonna go get some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.86,0:48:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,聪明的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smart girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.28,0:48:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我说要领路易到这区域里 转一转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I thought I'd take Louie, here, for a little tour of the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.70,0:48:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,参观一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show him around.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.04,0:48:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这主意太好了 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's a great idea. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.62,0:48:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟爸爸出去转转 那么我就带孩子们去探探险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go have fun with Daddy, and I'll explore around here with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.04,0:48:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 恩 好的 - 你会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, okay. Sure. - You'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.80,0:48:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,恩 好的 我只要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, great. I just gotta...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.72,0:48:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.52,0:49:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.31,0:49:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,路易 靠近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lou, come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.82,0:49:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太近了 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not so close. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.82,0:49:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,听着…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.49,0:49:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我实在看不下去了 你把人类的口袋扔掉 行吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can barely look at it. You gotta lose that human pocket, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.91,0:49:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是个腰包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a fanny pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.53,0:49:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"腰包"嘛 很可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Fanny pack." Adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.16,0:49:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是人类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's human.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.54,0:49:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你已经是部落的一员了 你以后用不着它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now that you're joining the tribe, you won't be needing it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.21,0:49:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在河边泥岸上见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll meet you by the clay banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.09,0:49:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"加入部落"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Joining the tribe"?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.34,0:49:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会以为我们真要搬到丛林里来的 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't actually think we're moving to the jungle, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.88,0:49:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他是因为我们来了 太激动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. He's just excited we're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.34,0:49:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,此时此刻 别扫兴了 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not ruin the moment, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.18,0:49:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再说了 不带这个腰包去又不会要了你的命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, it won't kill you to leave behind the fanny pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.27,0:49:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你赢了 我不带腰包就是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you win. I will leave the fanny pack behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.60,0:49:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,老婆开心 日子舒心…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy wife, happy li...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.40,0:49:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.61,0:49:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,玩的开心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.07,0:49:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 当然 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Sure. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.83,0:50:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 该起床了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys. Wakey-wakey!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.33,0:50:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 起床啦 - 伊娃 你有角色了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wake up! - Eva! You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.13,0:50:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那个"野性亚马逊"怎么样了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to "Amazon Untamed"?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.84,0:50:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我订了计划 今天面试…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the plan. Auditions today...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.93,0:50:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们明天预演一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we preview the show tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.18,0:50:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们？你在说什么啊 "我们"？你在说法语吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We"? What you talking about, "We"? You speak French?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.76,0:50:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 赶紧的 我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, chop-chop. Let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.02,0:50:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,她动作可够快的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid's been working.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.36,0:50:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 什么时候离开 告诉我这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me when to go Tell me when to go
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.57,0:50:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 什么时候离开 告诉我这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me when to go Tell me when to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.07,0:50:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,因为小妹很失望 失望 失望 失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause shawty got low, low, low, low, low
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.20,0:50:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了就可以开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any time you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.58,0:50:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,每次碰见个男的 我的心跳不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time I come a fella gotta get it
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.83,0:50:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想把他追到手 可是他们最后都灰溜溜地逃走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I gotta go, and then I gotta get it Then they gotta blow
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.62,0:50:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我就装傻 我就装酷 管他们想什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I gotta show that any little thing
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.81,0:50:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,做什么 我都不管 我都不理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fella think that he be doing
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.79,0:50:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这与我无关 到此结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause it doesn't matter, I'm done
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.13,0:50:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.01,0:51:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是神奇的巴西战舞龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are the amazing Capoeira Turtles.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.90,0:51:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太精彩了 再来一个 - 再来一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bravo! Encore! Encore! - Encore!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.90,0:51:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计们 刚才谁表演了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, guys. Did I miss anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.19,0:51:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,蚊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mosquito.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.34,0:51:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我叫格兰纳 我是水豚…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, my name is Claira the capybara...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.71,0:51:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我要唱一首我最喜欢的歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I will be singing my favorite song.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.09,0:51:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,回忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Memory
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.55,0:51:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,孤零零的站在月光里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All alone in the moonlight
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.56,0:51:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Touch me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.90,0:52:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,离开是如此的容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so easy to leave me
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.95,0:52:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,再这么吃下去我们就没有演员了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they keep eating each other, we got no show.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.07,0:52:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不是比谁吃的多啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't an all-you-can-eat competition!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.75,0:52:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你飞的好快 真的好快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. You are fast. You are really, really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.25,0:52:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我翅膀已经拉伤了 你这老鸟飞的还真快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I pulled a wing or something. You are really fast for an old bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.34,0:52:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 你的智慧 智慧 拥有很多智慧的鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For such a wise bird, is what I meant to say. Wise bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.34,0:52:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,智慧一般是随年龄一起增长的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which sometimes comes with age...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.10,0:52:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不过年轻的时候也增长 比如像你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but also can happen when you're young, like in your case.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.97,0:52:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样又年轻 又智慧 这种组合很少见…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could be wise and young, which is kind of a rare combination...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.39,0:52:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不过看到你真的好让人激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but thrilling when it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.68,0:52:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安静点 - 噢 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Be quiet. - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.27,0:52:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该把城市的习惯丢掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to shake that city off of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.98,0:52:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须要学习基本的丛林生存要素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to learn the basics of jungle survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.73,0:52:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我们是出来观光的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we were going sightseeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.32,0:52:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是训练日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's training day.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.32,0:52:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 泥土是你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! The mud is your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.61,0:52:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的伪装 感觉它 品尝它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your camouflage! Feel it. Taste it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.66,0:52:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没感觉 说明你的动作不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't feel crusty, you're not doing it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.66,0:52:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会想被人类看见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna be seen by humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.12,0:52:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,快点儿 你是蓝皮克斯鹦鹉还是火鸡？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Are you a macaw or a turkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.59,0:53:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 再快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster. Faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.59,0:53:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 你不想被吃掉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! You don't wanna be eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.52,0:53:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你独自一人在丛林里 你被陷阱抓住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're alone in the jungle. You get caught in a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.14,0:53:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你会怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.94,0:53:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我的腰包在的话…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had my fanny pack...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.31,0:53:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你要用你的嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! You use your beak.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.98,0:53:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的嘴 - 这是你最重要的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My beak. - It's your most important tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.78,0:53:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好的 不 我用我的嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay. No, I use my beak.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.45,0:53:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就差一点了 - 时间到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Almost. - Time's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.66,0:53:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话 你挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're jaguar meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.45,0:53:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特第一次就成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roberto got it on the first try.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.83,0:53:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.49,0:53:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,上 上 盘旋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up, up! And hover!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.79,0:53:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在 倒着飞 - 什么 倒飞？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, backwards! - What, backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.63,0:53:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不 只有蜂鸟才能倒着飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, only hummingbirds can fly backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.67,0:53:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,倒着飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.55,0:53:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,跨越 穿过 跨越\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over! Under! Over!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.67,0:53:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,穿过 跨越\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under! Over!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.80,0:53:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干得好 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good job. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.64,0:53:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,没说你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.85,0:53:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.60,0:53:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这是巴西栗树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brazil nut trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.64,0:53:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这些树对我们的生存至关重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These trees are the key to our way of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.81,0:54:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这些树为我们提供食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trees feed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.65,0:54:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,它们供养我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sustain us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.82,0:54:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 醒醒 - 我醒着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wake up! - I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.08,0:54:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,栗巴西还是… 巴西栗树什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nutty Brazil... Brazil nut trees, something.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.16,0:54:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.50,0:54:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这很重要 我们要保护这些树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is important. We have to protect these trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.79,0:54:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的未来要依靠他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our future depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.83,0:54:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 艾迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.17,0:54:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这跟班是谁啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is your sidekick?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.50,0:54:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在需要护士了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a nurse now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.17,0:54:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.01,0:54:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是不是离我们的地盘太近了点啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you boys getting a little bit too close to our side?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.84,0:54:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们说好的 费利佩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a deal, Felipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.22,0:54:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.89,0:54:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 我们对你是满怀深情的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know we got nothing but mad love for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.22,0:54:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计们快飞吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, boys, let's fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.14,0:54:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,给天空添些色彩吧 让他们去哭鼻子咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paint the sky. Before they start to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.52,0:54:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们挺和气的 - 树林那边是他们的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They seem nice. - They have their side of the grove...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.86,0:54:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这边是我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we have ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.19,0:54:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,最近食物短缺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Food is scarce these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.87,0:54:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,从没看见他们离我们的家园这么近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never seen them this close to the village before.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.33,0:54:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.25,0:55:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别让他们看到你 - 噢 对 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't let them see you! - Right, right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.71,0:55:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们应该去找琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should go find Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.55,0:55:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 琳达是什么？- 琳达是人 她把我养大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's a Linda? - Linda is the person that raised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.84,0:55:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？你是宠物？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You're a pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.72,0:55:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是你想的那样子的 我们是朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it wasn't anything like that. I was a companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.39,0:55:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢那样子吗？这解释了所有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You liked it? That explains everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.35,0:55:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 琳达是我的家人 - 家人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Linda is family. - Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.73,0:55:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,人类不是我们的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humans aren't family.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.90,0:55:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你没明白 他们是来帮忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you don't understand. They're coming here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.73,0:55:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.69,0:55:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不能带人类来我们的部落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not bring humans into the tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.57,0:55:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,远离人类我们才活到现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the only reason we're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.78,0:55:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这你总应该明白吧 懂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot be confused about this. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.24,0:55:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.58,0:55:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 观光结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sightseeing is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.75,0:55:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见鸟巢了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see the nest?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.17,0:55:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,图里奥 你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tulio, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.05,0:55:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine! I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.26,0:55:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.10,0:56:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,图里奥 他们在砍伐森林啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tulio, they're cutting down the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.61,0:56:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,琳达 你要去哪啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.44,0:56:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,去和他们说 你去跟鸟说 我去和人说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To talk to them. You talk to birds, I talk to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.69,0:56:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Wait, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.78,0:56:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.12,0:56:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.04,0:56:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我命令你把电锯关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take it easy with that chainsaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.91,0:56:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有很珍贵的鸟类居住在这片丛林里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are rare birds living around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.98,0:56:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能把这些树都砍掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't cut down these trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.13,0:56:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 亲爱的 你在这儿啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart! There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.09,0:56:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我到处找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.55,0:56:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你好 这儿真漂亮 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, there. Beautiful out here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.47,0:56:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你们迷路了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.26,0:56:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,迷路？没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.97,0:56:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,迷路？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.39,0:56:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.64,0:56:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是来度蜜月的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here on our honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.48,0:56:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正要回去和旅行团汇合呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're actually just heading back to join the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.15,0:56:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,今天晚上 有一场卡拉ok\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's karaoke night.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.98,0:56:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 亲爱的 人家还等着我们去唱"月亮河"呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come along, honey. Moon River isn't going to sing itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.66,0:56:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,琳达 这些人砍得可不止这些树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda, logs aren't the only things these guys cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.74,0:57:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 琳达 我拖住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, Linda. I'll hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.66,0:57:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快 快 快 - 好的 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go, go, go! Run! - Okay, okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.42,0:57:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,请让一下 请让一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.97,0:57:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们来比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, I'll race you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.93,0:57:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是太棒了 - 好样的 迪耶戈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is great! - All right, Tiago!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.89,0:57:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.06,0:57:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,迪耶戈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiago!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.94,0:57:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.86,0:57:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这太爽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.40,0:57:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你们回来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.82,0:57:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,玩得怎么样啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.87,0:57:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们玩的很开心 今天很有教育意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had a great time. It was educational.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.70,0:57:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 鲍勃叔叔教了我一些很酷的飞行技巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! Uncle Beto showed me some cool flying tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.83,0:57:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"叔叔"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Uncle"?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.92,0:57:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,看 我会倒着飞啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I can fly backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.29,0:57:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你超有天分的 天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you're a natural, T-Bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.34,0:57:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,丛林的生活技巧要从小时候就学起 迪耶戈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's never too soon to learn the ways of the jungle, Tiago.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.05,0:57:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可是有些家伙学不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although, some may never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.93,0:58:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去洗个澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.19,0:58:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特 我看见人类在丛林附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roberto, we saw humans near the grove.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.35,0:58:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你要保持警惕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.98,0:58:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"丛林的生活方法"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Ways of the jungle."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.23,0:58:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我还想学学"丛林的离开方法"呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would like to learn a way out of this jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.91,0:58:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那儿 我们的机会来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is. Now is our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.95,0:58:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是太激动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.33,0:58:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,准备舌头弹弓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare the tongue-a-pult.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.21,0:58:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,查理 让我重新飞起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie, make me fly again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.47,0:58:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,去干掉他们 老虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get them, tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.18,0:58:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快向征服你的凤头鹦鹉跪拜吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bow before the conquering cockatoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.73,0:58:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是有病啊 哥们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your problem, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.98,0:58:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,小鸟 好变态啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bird, that was sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.06,0:58:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 面试的时候就该有这种镜头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's the energy you bring into an audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.61,0:58:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,面试？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Audition?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.65,0:58:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我就是来面试的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's actually why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.99,0:58:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一个很棒的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a great little...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.66,0:58:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,您继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.49,0:59:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在寻找一个新的明星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're looking for a new star.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.03,0:59:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,明星？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Star?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.41,0:59:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你看上去很眼熟 我们是不是哪儿见过？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look familiar. Don't I know you from somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.87,0:59:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不会的 我叫…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't think so. No. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.92,0:59:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍勃 是的 鲍勃 小鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob. Yes. Bob, the bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.13,0:59:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 鲍勃 无所谓啦 展示才艺吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Bob, whatever. Show us what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.84,0:59:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 一开始我很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, at first I was afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.18,0:59:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我惊得目瞪口呆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was petrified
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.60,0:59:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直以为我没法再活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kept thinking that I could never live
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.69,0:59:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没法再展翅飞翔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could barely fly
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.90,0:59:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我在无数个慢慢长夜里回想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I spent, oh, so many nights
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.69,0:59:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,回想起他对我的残忍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thinking how he did me wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.40,0:59:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我变得坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I grew strong
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.66,0:59:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我学会了如何随遇而安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I learned how to get along
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.83,0:59:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 快滚 立刻 滚出这扇门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, now, go walk out the door
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.96,0:59:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,转身离开吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just turn around now
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.21,0:59:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这里是我的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is I who have the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.96,0:59:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你不就是那个想用分手来伤害我的人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weren't you the one who tried to hurt me with goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.01,1:00:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你以为我会垮掉 - 噢 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you think I'd crumble? - Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.26,1:00:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我会躺在这儿死掉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you think I'd lay down and die?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.30,1:00:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不 奈杰尔 你不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, not Nige
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.34,1:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我会活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will survive
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.81,1:00:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我知道怎么去恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as I know how to hate
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.02,1:00:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我就会活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I'll stay alive
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.35,1:00:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我会好好过这一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got all my life to live
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.27,1:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我又满腔的爱要付出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've got all my love to give
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.07,1:00:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会活下来 - 你会活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I will survive - You will survive
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.15,1:00:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会活下来 - 我们会活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I will survive - We will survive
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.45,1:00:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个幸存者 我的眼睛虎视眈眈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a survivor I've got the eye of a tiger
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.91,1:00:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不断地加强修炼 尽量多吃高纤维\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been training again And eating my fiber
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.49,1:00:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你仅仅只是活着 而我 却是是鲜活的活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You been staying alive Well, I've been staying alive-er
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.04,1:00:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你要坐稳了 我吐口水的时候声音响彻云霄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch where you sit when I spit my saliva, like boom
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.70,1:00:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来没见过一只凤头鹦鹉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've never seen a cockatoo
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.12,1:00:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,随着摇滚的节奏 又唱又跳 尽情摇摆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocking and shocking and dropping And popping and locking, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.21,1:00:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我的本事 都用不着调音器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch what I can do Without no Auto-Tune
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.00,1:00:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say what?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.05,1:00:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真的没有用噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.01,1:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你你打压我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you try to keep me down
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.97,1:00:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,只会让我变得更坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just come back stronger
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.43,1:00:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你想打断我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You try to cut me short
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.10,1:00:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,只会让我说的更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just come back longer
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.52,1:00:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想用乒乓球打败我 我会变成乒乓球健将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you beat me at ping pong I'll just play ping pong-er
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.69,1:00:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,给我个王位 我准备好上位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me my throne, I am ready to thrive
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.65,1:00:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing I know
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.32,1:00:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will survive
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.19,1:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我会活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will survive
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.41,1:01:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢 我是小鸟 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, thank you. I've been Bob the bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.08,1:01:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他真是太帅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is so hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.17,1:01:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 就是他 我要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom. That's it. You in.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.96,1:01:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你虽然不如伊娃 但是你很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're no Eva, but you're awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.29,1:01:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,明天晚上狂欢节演出的时候见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see you at the performance tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.59,1:01:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这里所有的鸟都会来看演出的 你一定会红到发紫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone from the village is coming. It's gonna be off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.55,1:01:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所有鸟？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.18,1:01:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所有鸟？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.47,1:01:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个完美的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the perfect plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.93,1:01:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,算你运气好 拔你几根刺 豪猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be happy we're only plucking you, porcupine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.77,1:01:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,滚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.44,1:01:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,与其满林子追那只鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead of chasing that bird all over the jungle...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.27,1:01:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不如让他演出的时候自己送上门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we let him come to us, at the Carnival show.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.44,1:01:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我会在舞台上迷住他们 而在观众席里…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll mesmerize them from the stage, while in the audience...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.32,1:01:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你 我的小加比…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you, my little Gabi...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.95,1:01:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你会成为我的 迷你致命武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll be my petite weapon of mass destruction.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.29,1:01:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这场演出将会是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be a performance...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.83,1:01:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好看到死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to die for.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.97,1:02:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我才笑得出那种气场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It only works when I do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.72,1:02:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 爱你噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.31,1:02:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So minty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.65,1:02:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.24,1:02:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 亲爱的 你在这儿 怎么这么长时间？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, sweetie, there you are. What's taking you so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.66,1:02:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,别再弄那个GPS了 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough with that GPS, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.58,1:02:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还要一起去看日落的 快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole tribe's gathering to watch the sunset. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.84,1:02:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 我刚找到琳达和图里奥的坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Hang on. I just found Linda and Tulio's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.92,1:02:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们刚刚就在林子的另一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are just on the other side of the grove.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.51,1:02:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 他们现在离得很近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, they're really close.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.55,1:02:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.51,1:02:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我知道你爸爸不相信人类…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I know your dad doesn't totally trust humans...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.43,1:02:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,可他一旦见到了 他就会改变想法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm sure if he met them, he would change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.76,1:02:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他们能确保这里安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can help keep this place safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.39,1:02:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 布鲁…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Blu...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.60,1:02:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸自己能解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my dad knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.90,1:03:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能 忘掉琳达和图里奥一会儿 好好享受日落？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And can't you just forget Linda and Tulio for one minute and enjoy a sunset?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.94,1:03:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 这是我们的计划啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I thought that was our plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.86,1:03:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,路线规划完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Route guidance complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.70,1:03:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 有些地方也许不该被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, maybe some places shouldn't be found.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.28,1:03:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也许就应该与世隔绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they should just be left alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.42,1:03:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她吃了一只虫子 一只虫子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She ate a bug. A bug!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.71,1:03:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁 布鲁 冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu, Blu, Blu! Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.96,1:03:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静？我们有个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down? We had a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.71,1:03:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助琳达和图里奥找到鹦鹉 然后回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help Linda and Tulio find the flock and get home.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.05,1:03:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我提醒她 她根本就不理我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when I mentioned it to her, she completely shut me down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.80,1:03:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,还有她的爸爸？他就是个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And her father? A total nut job.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.06,1:03:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他对人类的看法很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got this weird thing about humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.89,1:03:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他对人类的看法很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got this weird thing about humans!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.06,1:03:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他爱人类 他是个宠物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He loves them. He's a pet!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.73,1:03:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,宠物？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pet?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.90,1:03:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫我宠物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He called me a pet.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.27,1:03:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 他居然当我的面这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe he used the "P" word to my face.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.73,1:03:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,像是把我当成敌人似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like he thinks I'm the enemy or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.49,1:03:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟我们不是一路的 你要盯着点儿他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not one of us, Roberto. Keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.91,1:03:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那个罗伯特？他一直在监视着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that Roberto? He is always watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.32,1:03:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,总是在珠儿身边转啊转 又总是在唱着什么歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is always hovering around Jewel. He is always singing something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.04,1:03:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本比不上他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't compete with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.41,1:03:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你要拿出点鸟样来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta bird up, bird!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.54,1:04:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,从被驯养的状态中解放出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta emancipate yourself from domestication.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.87,1:04:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,用珠儿的眼光看这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to see this place through her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.96,1:04:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,去尝尝珠儿品尝的那些味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taste the flavors she's tasting.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.96,1:04:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,让我去吃虫子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I should eat a bug?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.42,1:04:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,想想都觉得恶心 在考虑下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just nasty, thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.63,1:04:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,闪光片 我的闪光片在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glitter. Where is my glitter?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.72,1:04:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,十分抱歉 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.80,1:04:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要听道歉 我要闪光片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want apologies. I want glitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.14,1:04:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,充满魔力的表演最终要靠的就是闪光片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glitter is absolutely essential for a magical performance.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.48,1:04:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么就不懂呢？- 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you know nothing? - Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.44,1:04:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,快去彩排 明天是个大日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rehearsals, big day tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.81,1:04:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,想起来了吗？来吧 你来吗 爸爸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ring a bell? Come on. You're coming, right, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.15,1:04:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.61,1:04:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子把娱乐搞得像是交作业似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That girl put the "business" in "show business."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.65,1:04:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁 记住…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu, remember...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.78,1:04:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道 老婆开心 日子舒心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, I know. Happy wife, happy life.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.62,1:04:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,多么美好的晨曦啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a glorious morning!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.84,1:04:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我都忘记了能够享受这样的早晨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot I could have mornings like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.30,1:04:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.77,1:05:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你最爱吃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.77,1:05:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你记得这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remembered.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.31,1:05:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that nice?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.65,1:05:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这感觉真是好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so crazy good.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.32,1:05:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you so much, Blu.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.79,1:05:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.50,1:05:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我要给珠儿一个惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be the one to surprise her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.67,1:05:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,给她送早餐 马上就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breakfast in bed, coming up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.04,1:06:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,巴西栗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brazil nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.21,1:06:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.34,1:06:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你们在这附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.93,1:06:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.89,1:06:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不 快回来 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Come back here. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.56,1:06:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.02,1:06:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not a toy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.27,1:06:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,违章驾驶 靠边停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Erratic driving. Pull over.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.95,1:06:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.10,1:07:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.47,1:07:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.94,1:07:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,总算找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.23,1:07:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,巴西栗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brazil nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.69,1:07:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这个才是我最重要的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my most important tool.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.38,1:07:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 好啊 瞧瞧这是谁来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well. What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.43,1:07:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,看样子不是所有的鸟都遵守老艾迪的规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess old Eddie's rules don't apply to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.77,1:07:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿是我们的地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're on our side.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.94,1:07:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 是吗？我不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Okay, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.56,1:07:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我没注意到 真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know that. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.98,1:07:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.15,1:08:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,闯进我们的地盘 抢我们的食物…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come over here, take our food...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.16,1:08:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你还侮辱我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now you insult me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.24,1:08:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 这件事情完全就是个误会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. This is all just a big misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.16,1:08:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 我非常想接受你的道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I wish I could accept your apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.29,1:08:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你看上去像是只好鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem like a nice bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.17,1:08:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,可是这代表战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this means war!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.75,1:08:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？有必要吗？能代表点别的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Does it have to? Can it mean something else?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.51,1:08:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 在死亡坑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, in the Pit of Doom.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.80,1:08:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 "死亡坑" 真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, the "Pit of Doom"? Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.35,1:08:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.43,1:08:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,正午了 我要腾出点地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High noon. I'll make some room.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.02,1:08:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,像扫帚一样把你扫出这片林子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweep you up like a broom.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.19,1:08:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你干了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.36,1:08:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.49,1:08:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 意外 - 嘿 出了什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- An accident? - Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.53,1:08:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢布鲁 我们可能要失去这片林子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to Drew, here, we could lose our entire side of the grove.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.49,1:08:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想去摘个坚果 就一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just trying to get a nut. One nut!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.95,1:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你都不喜欢吃坚果 这到底是怎么一回事 布鲁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't even like nuts! What's gotten into you, Blu?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.04,1:08:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我想给你准备点早餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was getting it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.88,1:08:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.84,1:08:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特 你带上最棒的鸟去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roberto, I want your best birds on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.38,1:09:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们绝不能不战而降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not giving up without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.22,1:09:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.30,1:09:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你 别管这事儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. Stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.55,1:09:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是净添麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.89,1:09:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 布鲁 他是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait! - Blu, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.56,1:09:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就让爸爸和罗伯特去处理这件事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should just let Dad and Roberto handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.56,1:09:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你也觉得我处理不了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think I can do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.23,1:09:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我只是不太清楚…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I just don't know...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.73,1:09:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,外交在不在你的专长范围内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it's your exact area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.48,1:09:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快走 死亡坑 现在 快走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, let's go, let's go! Pit of Doom, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.59,1:09:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,无线电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Radio!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.76,1:09:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你别介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.68,1:09:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我把这儿当自己家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made myself at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.89,1:09:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,棒棒糖？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lollipop?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.61,1:10:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真是可惜啊 你们两位大老远跑来保护这片森林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame, really. You came all this way to protect the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.57,1:10:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看看它会不会报答你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see if it will return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.70,1:10:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,极端环保主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tree huggers.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.55,1:10:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roberto.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.13,1:10:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,费利佩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felipe.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.93,1:10:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,给他点厉害瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No mercy!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.55,1:10:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我得阻止他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.76,1:10:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Blu!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.89,1:10:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,停下 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.60,1:10:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪 这太疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eduardo, this is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.06,1:10:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是高等物种 我们能更好的解决问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are an intelligent species with advanced problem-solving capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.10,1:10:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你挑起来的 等着瞧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought this on us. Now, watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.33,1:10:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,头冲上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.33,1:10:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴冲上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tails.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.71,1:10:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌这工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate this job.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.63,1:11:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这是比赛 这是比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a game. It's a game!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.51,1:11:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是比赛 这是战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a game! It's war.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.68,1:11:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,今天死亡坑天气真是不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a beautiful day in the Pit of Doom!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.85,1:11:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这是胜者为王的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's winner take all!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.98,1:11:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,七局四胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the best of seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.52,1:11:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,获胜者将得到整片的巴西栗子林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The winner will take control of the entire Brazil nut grove!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.86,1:11:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这就像足球 这我会玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just like soccer. I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.73,1:11:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么特别的战术吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, any special strategies?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.19,1:11:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们打什么阵型呢 4-4-2 还是 5-4-1\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we running at, 4-4-2 or a 5-4-1?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.15,1:11:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这做什么？教练 我踢什么位置啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we doing here, coach? What position do I play?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.20,1:11:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上我给你准备了一个合适的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I do have a perfect spot for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.03,1:11:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,水 这儿有水 来喝水吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water. Water here. Get your water.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.37,1:11:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.41,1:11:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特 他所向披靡势不可挡 到处都是他的身影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roberto is unstoppable! He's incredible! He's everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.08,1:11:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Roberto!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.59,1:11:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这我也能行啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have done that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.88,1:11:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特和对手保持距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roberto springs free!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.26,1:11:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在向前冲 一直向前冲 他射门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he goes, there he goes, there he goes! He shoots!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.93,1:11:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,进啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goal!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.09,1:11:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,进球啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goal!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.09,1:11:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,得分 得分啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goal! Goal!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.26,1:11:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,球进啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goal!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.39,1:11:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.94,1:12:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,费利佩抢到了球 红金刚鹦鹉…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felipe has the ball. The Red Macaws...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.11,1:12:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,誓要扭转局面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are making a comeback.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.40,1:12:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,费利佩传给提科 提科传给马里奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felipe pass to Tito. Tito with Mario.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.28,1:12:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,马里奥传给凯撒 凯撒传给安东尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mario with Cesar. Cesar to Antonio.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.57,1:12:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,安东尼射门得分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felipe scores!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.57,1:12:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 去你的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! In your face!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.20,1:12:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,费利佩 罗伯特 费利佩 罗伯特 费利佩 罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felipe, Roberto. Roberto, Felipe. Roberto, Felipe. Felipe, Roberto!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.75,1:12:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,射门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goal!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.13,1:12:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这一定很疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That has got to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.25,1:12:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,上 上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.63,1:12:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,费利佩 利佩 利佩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felipe-lipe-lipe!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.76,1:12:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.93,1:12:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,犯规\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foul!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.93,1:12:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧 裁判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, ref!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.60,1:12:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.77,1:12:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.56,1:12:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没说你 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you. You.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.89,1:12:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,学着点吧…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch and learn...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.27,1:12:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,送水小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}water boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.81,1:12:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你上场吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, just get in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.78,1:12:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.57,1:12:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 开始吧 教练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Here we go, coach.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.28,1:12:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.28,1:12:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有位替补队员上场了 他会是秘密武器吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new player is coming off the bench. Is he a secret weapon?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.24,1:12:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他就是送水那小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's the water boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.91,1:13:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 没人防我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm open!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.08,1:13:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没人防我 把球传给我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm open, toss it to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.62,1:13:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 传给我 我这儿没人防守 快传给我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, pass to me, I'm open. I'm wide open!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.42,1:13:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把球传给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass the ball to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.84,1:13:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你把球传给我 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the pass, Blu!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.42,1:13:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,借用一下 可以吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind if I borrow this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.59,1:13:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特向前挺进 他避开一个防守…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roberto moves in. He shakes one...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.63,1:13:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,又避开一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then another!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.68,1:13:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roberto!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.80,1:13:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,球进啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goal!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.30,1:13:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 好耶 噢 好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.32,1:13:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在在死亡坑里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are tied in the Pit of Doom.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.15,1:13:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来谁先进球…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever scores next...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.99,1:13:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,谁就赢得比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wins it all!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.49,1:13:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我来接 我来接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.28,1:13:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Blu.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.46,1:13:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢 送水小子突然表现出了专业水准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! The water boy is suddenly playing like a pro!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.17,1:13:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,把球传给罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass the ball to Roberto!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.97,1:13:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,快传球 快传球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass the ball! Pass the ball!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.85,1:14:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 布鲁 等等 - 不 我自己能搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blu, wait! - No, this bird's got it covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.57,1:14:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,球进了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goal!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.54,1:14:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去这个秘密武器 突然走火了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like the secret weapon just backfired!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.71,1:14:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来看看艾迪现在的反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go to Eduardo for his reaction.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.72,1:14:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了这只该死的宠物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna kill you, fanny pack!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.90,1:14:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这啊 老艾迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it out, old Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.35,1:14:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看样子你们没有坚果吃了 只能减肥了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you guys are going to have to start a nut-free diet.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.69,1:14:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这场比赛在我们那儿会传为佳话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be talking about that for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.53,1:15:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不该对人类的宠物报抱什么希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should never have expected more from a human's pet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.93,1:15:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.93,1:15:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才你怎么回事儿啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.77,1:15:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我太想融入这个大家庭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was trying to be one of the tribe.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.14,1:15:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但我可能永远都不能成为你爸爸希望的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I guess I'm never gonna be "the bird" like your dad wants me to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.48,1:15:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说什么？- 我想我们该回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I think it's time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.82,1:15:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我正要跟你说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.74,1:15:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk about what?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.45,1:15:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁 看看周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu, look around.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.95,1:15:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们这里 在野外玩的这么的开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kids are thriving. They love being in the wild.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.29,1:15:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这里就是我们的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe this place is home.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.29,1:15:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的家？这里是我们的家？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home? How could this be home?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.75,1:15:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽全力适应这里 尽力去帮助他们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have done everything I can to fit in and help out...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.96,1:15:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,可我做什么都不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but no matter what I do, it's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.67,1:15:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我们的家 珠儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not home, Jewel.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.30,1:15:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也许属于你 但不是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe for you, but not for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.30,1:16:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗？你应该清楚你到底需要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? You need to figure out what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.30,1:16:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 别老想着你自己 也为我们想想吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And maybe, stop thinking about just yourself and start thinking about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.51,1:16:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 听听老大说的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you heard the boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.85,1:16:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,出发 出发 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move out! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.98,1:16:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.33,1:17:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,琳达 图里奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda! Tulio!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.34,1:17:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Linda.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.85,1:17:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 小腰包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, fanny pack.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.56,1:17:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,请在能拐弯的时候拐弯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around when possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.89,1:17:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 GPS小姐 不是你的错 是我的不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, GPS lady. It's not you. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.23,1:17:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 煎饼 再见 咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, pancakes. Goodbye, coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.15,1:17:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.08,1:17:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,琳达？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.75,1:17:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.96,1:17:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eduardo was right!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.17,1:18:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是个叛徒 - 等等 你不明白？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Traitor! - Wait, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.84,1:18:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我有什么不明白的 与人类为伍？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What don't I understand? Siding with humans?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.26,1:18:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你对人类了解多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you even know about humans?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.18,1:18:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我很了解他们 他们引诱你 把你抓起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know everything. They lure you in, they trap you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.93,1:18:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还给你洗脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They destroy your mind!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.76,1:18:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,鹦鹉要吃饼干吗？要吃饼干吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Polly want a cracker? Polly want a cracker?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.85,1:18:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我受够饼干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Enough crackers!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.85,1:18:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate crackers!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.27,1:18:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 罗伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Roberto!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.32,1:18:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们 是他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's them. It's them!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.69,1:18:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's them!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.78,1:18:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,罗伯特 从这滚开…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roberto, get out of...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.12,1:18:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 不要 我不要饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not again! Not again! No more crackers!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.62,1:18:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.79,1:18:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.62,1:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有个机会阻止这一切 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've got one chance to stop this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.37,1:18:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找到我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to find my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.38,1:18:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你飞回去警告大家 明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fly back and warn the others. You got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.38,1:18:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.63,1:18:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 快去 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. Go! - Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.13,1:18:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,人类 人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humans, humans!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.31,1:18:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 往你的左边 你的右边 - 我的左边？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your left! Your right! - My left?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.97,1:18:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,左还是右？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left or right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.23,1:19:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的右腿 我的左腿 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your right leg, my left leg. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.23,1:19:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good! Good! Good!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.48,1:19:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在 往上爬 - 往上爬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, go up. - Go up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.99,1:19:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,差一点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reach!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.99,1:19:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.99,1:19:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.49,1:19:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.16,1:19:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然情况很糟糕…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As bad as this is...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.12,1:19:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我全世界哪儿也不想去 只想和你在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is no place I would rather be in the whole world than with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.83,1:19:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕是被拴在一棵树上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if it is tied to a tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.51,1:19:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Linda!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.35,1:19:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.64,1:19:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.81,1:19:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 琳达？- 下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Linda? - Down here!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.98,1:19:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Blu!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.52,1:19:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么在这儿？这里很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here? This is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.36,1:19:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真难以置信 里约飞到这儿有2千英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's incredible! It's a 2,000-mile flight!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.03,1:19:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们跟着他 - 太神奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's follow him! - It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.82,1:19:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说我听到他的声音了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I heard him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.21,1:20:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,还给我钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take those.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.91,1:20:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都完了 完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game over! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.83,1:20:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,人类 那些光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humans! The lights!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.04,1:20:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,都完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.50,1:20:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,自从我们找到他 他就不停的说胡话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been blabbering like this since we found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.67,1:20:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,伐木工来了 布鲁和他们在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The loggers are coming! And Blu is with them!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.88,1:20:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是个叛徒 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Traitor! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.01,1:20:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不 布鲁是想帮助我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Blu is trying to help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.59,1:20:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？就他自己？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? By himself?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.01,1:20:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快撤 我们得离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's evacuate! We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.76,1:20:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的鸟立刻出发 快离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Everyone move out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.10,1:20:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快 快啊 - 爸爸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go, go, go! - Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.43,1:21:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这次不行 我不能和你一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not this time. I'm not going with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.39,1:21:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须和我一起走 我不能再让家人面临危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to go with me! I will not put my family in danger again.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.35,1:21:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁也是我的家人 我不会丢下他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu is my family, and I'm not leaving him behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.19,1:21:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.19,1:21:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.78,1:21:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 埃德沃德 也许我不是这里最有鸟样的鸟…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Eduardo, I might not be the birdliest bird in the flock...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.37,1:21:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 就现在来说 这是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, for once, that's actually a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.62,1:21:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你了解丛林…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the jungle...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.96,1:21:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.62,1:21:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们合作就能阻止伐木工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know that, together, we can stop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.42,1:21:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让他们夺走我们的家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't let them take our home.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.63,1:21:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然这里又热又吵 到处是恐怖的虫子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, it's hot and loud and filled with creepy bugs...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.97,1:21:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可这是属于我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.59,1:21:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要为这而战 谁跟我去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's fight for it. Who's with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.97,1:21:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.60,1:21:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody else?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.11,1:21:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,停下 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.44,1:21:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.16,1:22:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.12,1:22:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了 请尊重热带雨林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Respect the rainforest!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.44,1:22:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道 我就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.86,1:22:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你这是要去哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.32,1:22:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那只不过是一群该死的鸽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a bunch of pigeons.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.36,1:22:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,给我回去干活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back to work!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.66,1:22:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你带头 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead the way, Blu.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.41,1:22:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,终于叫对了 是的 你叫我布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my name! Yes! You called me Blu.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.46,1:22:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我叫布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I am Blu!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.29,1:22:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.38,1:22:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有蓝色羽毛的鸟…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Birds of blue feathers...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.00,1:22:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,团结在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have to stick together!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.18,1:23:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？现在往下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody ready? And under!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.48,1:23:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,往上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.57,1:23:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,倒飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Backwards!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.03,1:23:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我会活下去 我会活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will survive I will survive
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.25,1:23:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抓到了 - 哇 好准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got him! - Wow, precise.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.09,1:23:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不怕什么鸟呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't afraid of no birds.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.38,1:23:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.22,1:23:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,亚马逊保卫战开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on in the Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.97,1:23:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,准备 扔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, hit it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.39,1:23:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,击掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High-five!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.19,1:23:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.23,1:23:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,给我振作起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a grip!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.66,1:24:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,炮弹来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.37,1:24:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halt!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.00,1:24:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.54,1:24:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,查理 给我准备鼻射炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie, prepare the nose-zooka.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.21,1:24:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,迪耶戈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiago!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.50,1:24:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这才对嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.09,1:24:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,准备…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.13,1:24:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}aim...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.38,1:24:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.39,1:24:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,又失手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foiled again.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.97,1:24:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干得好 迪耶戈 - 爸爸 我们是最棒的团队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good job, Tiago. - We're a great team, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.31,1:24:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 老艾迪 - 费利佩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, old Eddie. - Felipe.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.94,1:24:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我会错过这个机会？比赛开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I would miss this party? Game on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.15,1:24:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 快回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.07,1:24:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一群饭桶 没用的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're useless, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.62,1:24:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.66,1:24:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,要打架 找个个子和你一样大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick on someone your own size.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.17,1:25:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.30,1:25:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,接住你了 接住你了 别害怕 没事了 你安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you, I got you. It's okay, you're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.52,1:25:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是琳达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a Linda.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.28,1:25:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.78,1:25:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还是这么默契 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still got it, Blu!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.63,1:25:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事都得我亲自干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to do everything myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.47,1:25:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 给我从那滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Get away from that!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.30,1:25:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没有人能抢我的戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No one steals my scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.35,1:25:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,棒棒糖？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lollipop?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.24,1:26:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.03,1:26:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.78,1:26:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃命吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.74,1:26:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 快放开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.20,1:26:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我绝不 - 你疯了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Never! - Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.25,1:26:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你会把我们两个都害死的 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll bring both of us down! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.58,1:26:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,飞呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.21,1:26:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,似曾相识吧 布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dejavu, Blu.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.96,1:26:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,奈杰尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nigel!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.46,1:26:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blu!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.93,1:26:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,奈杰尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nigel!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.62,1:26:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.58,1:26:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你要为你的罪恶付出最惨痛的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will pay a painful price for your pestilence!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.00,1:26:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 停下 住手 别过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, stop that! Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.96,1:27:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,用我愤怒的羽毛 扇肿你的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A flurry of furious feathers in your face!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.63,1:27:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你没必要这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.34,1:27:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我就是想这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I just want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.59,1:27:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 停下 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.80,1:27:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天哪 查理 机会来了 机会来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my goodness. Charlie! This is it. This is it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.80,1:27:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住 稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady. Steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.76,1:27:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,扇耳光比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slap fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.93,1:27:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就是现在 发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot! Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.82,1:27:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,奈杰尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nigel!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.83,1:27:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我就要死了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the end?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.04,1:27:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我太年轻…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was too young...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.67,1:27:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,又太英俊 天妒英才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}too beautiful to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.84,1:27:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鲍勃？- 等下 那不是鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bob? - Hold up! That ain't Bob!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.18,1:27:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说嘛 我在哪里见过他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I knew him from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.22,1:27:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我最后的谢幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My final curtain call.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.01,1:27:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只剩下站票了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's standing room only.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.73,1:28:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.20,1:28:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.62,1:28:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我干了些什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.62,1:28:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不能与汝同生…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I cannot liveth with thee...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.71,1:28:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那我不如死了算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then I shall not liveth at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.23,1:28:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那只青蛙它没有毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That frog is not poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.15,1:28:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.57,1:28:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有死？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.99,1:28:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这个品种经常被搞错 但是她是只假的箭毒蛙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a very common mistake. But she's a harmless pseudo-dendrobates.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.32,1:28:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,从她粉色的斑点就能看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tell by the pink spots.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.95,1:29:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,可我父母从小告诉我说 我有剧毒 叫我别碰任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my parents always told me I was poisonous and shouldn't touch anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.50,1:29:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你是你爹妈充话费送的吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just had really mean parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.92,1:29:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 哇噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.42,1:29:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那么现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, now...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.63,1:29:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以在一起啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can be together!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.59,1:29:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 奈杰尔 奈杰尔 我的维克多 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nigel! Nigel-Wigel-Wigglepuss! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.01,1:29:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁来救救我 - 我绝对不会放你走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Somebody, help me! - I'm going to never let you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.10,1:29:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 我会学好的 不 - 绝对不会放你走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry, I'll be nicer. No! - Never gonna let you go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.94,1:29:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不 查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.77,1:29:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.69,1:29:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是违反自然法则的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is unnatural!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.79,1:29:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.75,1:29:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我的头发没弄脏吧？好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing in my hair, right? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.00,1:29:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从亚马逊的腹地中…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Directly from the heart of the Amazon rainforest...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.51,1:29:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,为你带来特大新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have some breaking news.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.38,1:29:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了图里奥博士和他的团队…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to Dr. Monteiro and his team...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.51,1:30:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的整片区域都将会制定为 国家野生鸟类保护区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the entire area will be designated as a National Wildlife Refuge.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.18,1:30:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们大家会一起确保这里的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And together, we'll make sure this place stays safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.35,1:30:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗 布鲁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, Blu?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.81,1:30:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息还不止这一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not the only good news.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.06,1:30:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在丛林深处找到这只凤头鹦鹉…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found this cockatoo deep in the Amazon...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.36,1:30:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像和一只树蛙黏在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he seems to have bonded with a tree frog.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.07,1:30:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会把它带回里约 进行持续的观察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are bringing them back to Rio for continuing observation.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.07,1:30:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 奈杰尔 我们要去里约度蜜月啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Nigel! Wow! A honeymoon in Rio!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.50,1:30:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一起来 拍手 拍手 摇尾巴…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your paws, talons and tails together...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.71,1:30:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是丛林里有史以来最强大的明星阵容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the most amazing talent ever gathered in one jungle.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.75,1:30:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,下面请看"野性亚马逊"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's "Amazon Untamed!"
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.55,1:30:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.55,1:30:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.68,1:30:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？别咬我 怎么啦？别咬我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up? Don't bite it What's up? Don't bite it
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.56,1:30:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的鸟儿朋友们呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where my birds at?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.89,1:30:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,无论去到哪里 我们都会在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're together no matter Where we might go
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.94,1:30:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,翅膀挥舞起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flap your wings!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.19,1:30:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我们不在一起 我们就不能远行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're not all together We can't go far
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.28,1:30:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,亚马逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazon!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.19,1:30:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们最爱的绿宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an emerald we treasure
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.87,1:31:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,从密林来到你的面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming from the jungle to you
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.03,1:31:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,砰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bam!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.58,1:31:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,拍打的是心跳的节奏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beating like its heart beats
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.54,1:31:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,演绎的是自由的音符\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Playing rhythms we've grown to
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.04,1:31:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们最爱的绿宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the emerald we treasure
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.88,1:31:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来自我们生活的地方 - 我们生活的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Coming from the place where we live - The place where we live
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.59,1:31:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 充满着自由和欢乐 - 欢乐无限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The home of freedom and happiness - Happiness
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.22,1:31:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,时光不停飞逝 丛林还是一如既往 真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time flies forever The jungle's like a breeze, it's a wonder
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.72,1:31:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,丛林就像一阵清风 快穿上舞裙 随时有人叫你跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get out your tutu In case someone wants you to dance
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.89,1:31:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 亚马逊 - 嘿 路易兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello, Amazon! - Hey, Luiz!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.06,1:31:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 小鸟们 我来了 - 欢迎来到丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey birds, I made it! - Welcome to the jungle, dawg!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.11,1:31:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,所有我们乌龟们 硬汉乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All my turtles! Hardcore turtles!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.92,1:31:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,唱吧 宝贝儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sing it, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.42,1:31:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,拉菲尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rafi!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.88,1:32:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定真的要在亚马逊安家吗…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you can make the Amazon our home...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.05,1:32:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有热又有恐怖的虫子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the heat and the creepy bugs?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.43,1:32:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑？我可是丛林先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding? I am Mr. Jungle.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.56,1:32:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,充满野性而且还很有鸟样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Totally wild, and very birdly.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.10,1:32:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,夏天还是去里约避暑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we can do summers in Rio.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.31,1:32:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的唯一 珠儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my one and only, Jewel.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.19,1:32:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,无论去到哪里 我们都会在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're together No matter where we might go
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.70,1:32:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,永远在一起 我们才能走得更远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forever together We can go far
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.58,1:32:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the end?
